{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46954","headline":"送韩蜕秀才赴举 · 齐己","name":"送韩蜕秀才赴举","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"槐花馆驿暮尘昏，此去分明吏部孙。\n才器合居科第首，风流幸是缙绅门。\n春和洛水清无浪，雪洗高峰碧断根。\n堪想都人齐指点，列仙相次上崑仑。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"齐己","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_46954.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46954","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}